# ==============================================================================
# COMPLIANCE BOUNDARY: RAW BINARY ISOLATION
# All raw binary artifacts (*.pdf, *.docx, *.xlsx, *.pptx, *.eml) remain strictly UNTRACKED.
# Only high-fidelity Markdown (*.md) and embedded web images (*.png, *.jpg) are committed.
# ==============================================================================

# Raw Binary Documents & Presentations
*.docx
*.doc
*.xlsx
*.xls
*.pptx
*.ppt
*.pdf
*.eml
*.msg
*.odp
*.wrf
*.heic
*.HEIC
*.mp4
*.mov
*.avi
*.m4a
*.mp3
*.zip
*.tar
*.gz

# OS & Temp Files
.DS_Store
*.log
~$*
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Dependencies & Build Artifacts
node_modules/
dist/
build/
.vite/

